on","blurb":"family-easy to serious guided rafting","when":"mid-Dec to Apr","commission":"operator resell / Viator (OutsideAgents)"},{"name":"Venado Caves","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","hook":"limestone caverns + subterranean river","bookable_category":"guided caving tour","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.adventuretourscostarica.com/destinations/la-fortuna-arenal","timing":"mid-Dec to Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"expedition","blurb":"limestone caverns + subterranean river","when":"mid-Dec to Apr","commission":"operator (OutsideAgents)"},{"name":"Arenal 1968 Trail / Cerro Chato area","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","hook":"lava-flow hiking, cone & lake views (no summit)","bookable_category":"guided hike / park entry","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.adventuretourscostarica.com/destinations/la-fortuna-arenal","timing":"mid-Dec to Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"expedition","blurb":"lava-flow hiking, cone & lake views (no summit)","when":"mid-Dec to Apr","commission":"guide fee (OutsideAgents); park entry non-comm"},{"name":"Ecotermales Fortuna","si_tag":"RHM","status":"live","hook":"intimate capacity-capped romantic hot springs","bookable_category":"timed pass / package","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.machupicchu.org/arenal-hot-springs-guide-2026-tabacon-baldi-free-options.htm","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"romance","blurb":"intimate capacity-capped romantic hot springs","when":"year-round","commission":"bundle via DMC/resort (OutsideAgents); gate non-comm"},{"name":"Sloth / nocturnal wildlife night walk","si_tag":"RHM","status":"live","hook":"guided rainforest night hike (sloths, frogs, birds)","bookable_category":"guided walk","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.adventuretourscostarica.com/destinations/la-fortuna-arenal","timing":"mid-Dec to Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"romance","blurb":"guided rainforest night hike (sloths, frogs, birds)","when":"mid-Dec to Apr","commission":"operator (OutsideAgents)"},{"name":"Coffee & chocolate (cacao) tour","si_tag":"WELLNESS_THERMAL/CULTURE","status":"future","hook":"farm-to-cup + bean-to-bar half-day","bookable_category":"guided tour","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.adventuretourscostarica.com/destinations/la-fortuna-arenal","timing":"mid-Dec to Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"WELLNESS_THERMAL/CULTURE","blurb":"farm-to-cup + bean-to-bar half-day","when":"mid-Dec to Apr","commission":"operator/affiliate (OutsideAgents)"},{"name":"Lake Arenal SUP / windsurf","si_tag":"GEA","status":"live","hook":"Costa Rica''s largest lake + wind corridor","bookable_category":"rental / lesson","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.adventuretourscostarica.com/destinations/la-fortuna-arenal","si":"expedition","blurb":"Costa Rica''s largest lake + wind corridor","commission":"operator (OutsideAgents)"}],"faq":[{"q":"Can you climb Arenal Volcano?","a":"No — you cannot summit Arenal, because it is an active volcano. The hikeable product is the Arenal 1968 Trail and the National Park loops, walking hardened lava flows with lake-and-cone views; the active cone itself is closed to hikers.","source":"adventuretourscostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Which Arenal hot springs are best for couples?","a":"Ecotermales Fortuna is the romantic pick. It is intimate and capacity-capped — romantic, not a waterpark — at a $59 timed pass, a better couples fit than the larger complexes like Baldi ($85), The Springs ($75) or Tabacón (~$99–110).","source":"machupicchu.org, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"How hot are the Arenal hot springs?","a":"They run roughly 90–104°F. The mineral water is heated by the volcano itself, and the region''s best springs have been built around by high-end resorts, rustic lodges and luxury hotels — hydrate, limit soak time and go easy on alcohol in the heat.","source":"adventuretourscostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"wellness"},{"q":"Is the Arenal volcano dangerous to visit?","a":"No — Arenal is an active but monitored volcano, and guided viewing is the whole point. The one hard rule is no summit hikes on the active cone; only the 1968 Trail, Cerro Chato-area and National Park loops are open to hikers.","source":"adventuretourscostarica.com, 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"La Fortuna & Arenal Volcano, Costa Rica — Hot Springs, Waterfalls & Adventure | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan La Fortuna / Arenal: active-volcano hikes, the 246-ft La Fortuna Waterfall, whitewater rafting, hanging bridges, and world-class hot springs — from Nayara to Tabacon. Expert, sourced, bookable.","slug":"la-fortuna-arenal-costa-rica","primary_keyword":"La Fortuna Costa Rica","long_tail":["Arenal Volcano hot springs","things to do in La Fortuna","La Fortuna Waterfall hike","Nayara Tented Camp Arenal","La Fortuna vs Monteverde"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","search_language":"es-CR","local_keywords":["qué hacer en La Fortuna","aguas termales Arenal","volcán Arenal tour","catarata La Fortuna","rafting río Balsa","puentes colgantes Arenal"],"hreflang":["en","es-CR"]},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","status":"live"},{"si":"wellness","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Nayara Tented Camp","why_ultra":"LHW/Virtuoso stilted luxury tents, best cone views, plunge pools","earning":"consortia rate + commission ~10%+","virtuoso_value_add":"arrival upgrade + resort/spa credit + daily breakfast (verify block)","mor":false,"tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Nayara Springs","why_ultra":"adults-only plunge-pool casitas; honeymoon apex","earning":"consortia + commission","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade + credit (verify)","mor":false,"tier":"ultra"}